Apple today <a href="https://www.apple.com/tv-pr/news/2026/04/apple-tvs-emmy-award-winning-global-smash-hit-series-ted-lasso-returns-for-season-four-on-wednesday-august-5/">announced</a> that its hit comedy-drama series "<a href="https://www.apple.com/tv-pr/originals/ted-lasso/">Ted Lasso</a>" is returning for a fourth season with a first episode on Wednesday, August 5. One new episode will follow every Wednesday thereafter through October 7.<br/>
